NHV_Q00_010_1003,Q00,10,V2_standoff,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Not a field. A family that need not spend its remaining years remembering what it used to be.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten standoff; Feinschliff auf Entwicklerwunsch: Metapher vor Name und Angebot. Ablauf in flow.json.
