NHV_Q00_010_1041,Q00,10,V2_standoff,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Veyra Othren. Though some in the old sanctuaries knew me as the Gleaner.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten standoff; Feinschliff auf Entwicklerwunsch: Metapher vor Name und Angebot. Ablauf in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_010_1005,Q00,10,V2_recognition,Cicero,Vanilla,Puzzled,45,That face. Cicero has seen that face beside Mother's coffin. It was not smiling then.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten recognition; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1006,Q00,10,V2_recognition,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Nor was yours, Cicero.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten recognition; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1042,Q00,10,V2_harvest_question,Player,-,Neutral,50,"Then speak plainly, Veyra. What are you offering?",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Feinschliff 29.09.2026; Ablauf und Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1043,Q00,10,V2_harvest_question,Player,-,Neutral,50,We've buried enough. What would you have us harvest?,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Feinschliff 29.09.2026; Ablauf und Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1044,Q00,10,V2_harvest_plain,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"People, Listener. There are killers beyond these walls who have found no purpose for what they are.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Feinschliff 29.09.2026; Ablauf und Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1045,Q00,10,V2_harvest_plain,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Some might find it here. I can help you seek them out, if you will hear me.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Feinschliff 29.09.2026; Ablauf und Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1046,Q00,10,V2_harvest_plain,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,Recruits. You might have led with that.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Feinschliff 29.09.2026; Ablauf und Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1047,Q00,10,V2_harvest_plain,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Happy,30,And deprived you of the chance to ask my name?,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Feinschliff 29.09.2026; Ablauf und Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1048,Q00,10,V2_harvest_plain,Babette,Vanilla,Neutral,30,Finding a killer is easy. Finding one worth keeping takes longer.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Feinschliff 29.09.2026; Ablauf und Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1049,Q00,10,V2_harvest_plain,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Which is why I bring you possibilities. The choice remains yours, Listener.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Feinschliff 29.09.2026; Ablauf und Gates in flow.json. 
