NHV_Q00_010_1012,Q00,10,V2_standoff_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,I'll ask the Night Mother. Wait at the Windpeak Inn.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl standoff_hub -> departure; Gates in flow.json; keine implementierten CK-Conditions.
