NHV_Q00_010_1014,Q00,10,V2_gleaner,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"After a harvest, someone gathers what the reapers left. That has been my work for a very long time.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten gleaner; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1015,Q00,10,V2_gleaner,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"In my case, people. A killer without a purpose. A survivor with nowhere to go.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten gleaner; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1016,Q00,10,V2_gleaner,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,I watch them before I offer their names. Some never make it onto the page.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten gleaner; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1017,Q00,10,V2_gleaner,Player,-,Neutral,50,So every murderer is a possible recruit?,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl gleaner -> murderers; Gates in flow.json; keine implementierten CK-Conditions.
NHV_Q00_010_1018,Q00,10,V2_gleaner,Player,-,Neutral,50,I've heard enough about your work. For now.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl gleaner -> standoff_hub; Gates in flow.json; keine implementierten CK-Conditions.
NHV_Q00_010_1019,Q00,10,V2_murderers,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,A murder tells me where to look. It does not tell me whom to trust.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten murderers; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1020,Q00,10,V2_murderers,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Someone who needs a new enemy every morning will eventually find one at your table.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten murderers; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1021,Q00,10,V2_door,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,It proves I was trusted with an answer. Nothing more. The invitation must come from you.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten door; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1022,Q00,10,V2_door,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,You might have tried asking before walking in.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten door; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1023,Q00,10,V2_door,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,You would have had a quieter evening. I suspect I would still be outside.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten door; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1024,Q00,10,V2_late,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Sad,35,I found ashes. Coming sooner is a comfort I cannot offer the dead.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten late; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1025,Q00,10,V2_late,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,I can offer the living something useful. Names. People worth finding before someone else finds them.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten late; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1026,Q00,10,V2_late,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,Useful is a promising start. It isn't an answer to everything.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten late; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1027,Q00,10,V2_late,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,No. You should distrust anyone who brings one of those.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten late; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1028,Q00,10,V2_mother_past,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,I have spoken with the Mother in a way you would not yet understand.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten mother_past; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1029,Q00,10,V2_mother_past,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Her words to the Brotherhood are yours to hear, Listener. I have come with an offer, not a message.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten mother_past; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1030,Q00,10,V2_mother_past,Player,-,Neutral,50,Then you won't speak in her place.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl mother_past -> mother_limit; Gates in flow.json; keine implementierten CK-Conditions.
NHV_Q00_010_1031,Q00,10,V2_mother_past,Player,-,Neutral,50,I'll put that question to her myself.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl mother_past -> standoff_hub; Gates in flow.json; keine implementierten CK-Conditions.
NHV_Q00_010_1032,Q00,10,V2_mother_limit,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Nor choose in yours. Ask her about me. You needn't take my history on trust.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten mother_limit; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1033,Q00,10,V2_blade,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,Very well. The blade comes down. My attention stays where it is.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,"INACTIVE V2; Knoten blade; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. Spieler adressiert Nazir; spätere CK-Fassung als eigener Branch oder Szene, nicht als Veyra-Antwort-INFO."
NHV_Q00_010_1034,Q00,10,V2_blade,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Happy,15,I find that arrangement quite reasonable.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,"INACTIVE V2; Knoten blade; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. Spieler adressiert Nazir; spätere CK-Fassung als eigener Branch oder Szene, nicht als Veyra-Antwort-INFO."
NHV_Q00_010_1035,Q00,10,V2_dismiss,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Then I will wait at the Windpeak Inn. If you want me back, you know where to look.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten dismiss; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1036,Q00,10,V2_departure,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Ask her whether my work is welcome. I will wait at the Windpeak Inn.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten departure; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_010_1037,Q00,10,V2_departure_reason,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,Then ask her. Knowing the answer to a door does not earn this woman's place behind it.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten departure_reason; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. Erst nach letzter Response Stage 15; keine Frage davor löst den Abschied aus.
NHV_Q00_010_1038,Q00,10,V2_departure_reason,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,I will leave you to it.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 10,INACTIVE V2; Knoten departure_reason; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. Erst nach letzter Response Stage 15; keine Frage davor löst den Abschied aus.
NHV_Q00_015_1000,Q00,15,V2_exit,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Give me a moment to get past Nazir. He has made a rather thorough doorway.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 15,"INACTIVE V2; Knoten exit; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. Räumlicher Übergang: sichtbarer Abschied, dann Windpeak; Vorschau simuliert den vorhandenen Stage-15/20-Ablauf."
NHV_Q00_020_1000,Q00,20,V2_inn_early,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Back already? I would rather hear what the Mother said than how far you walked.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Knoten inn_early; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_020_1001,Q00,20,V2_inn_early,Player,-,Neutral,50,I haven't spoken to her yet.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl inn_early -> inn_wait; Gates in flow.json; keine implementierten CK-Conditions.
NHV_Q00_020_1002,Q00,20,V2_inn_early,Player,-,Neutral,50,I wanted to know whether you'd wait.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl inn_early -> inn_patience; Gates in flow.json; keine implementierten CK-Conditions.
NHV_Q00_020_1003,Q00,20,V2_inn_wait,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Then we are both waiting. She is in the Sanctuary, Listener. I shall remain here.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Knoten inn_wait; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_020_1004,Q00,20,V2_inn_patience,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Happy,15,The room is warm. The innkeeper has asked only for coin. I have endured worse arrangements.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Knoten inn_patience; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_020_1005,Q00,20,V2_nm_start,NightMother,Vanilla,Neutral,30,My Listener. You have heard the Gleaner's offer. Now hear me.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Knoten nm_start; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_020_1006,Q00,20,V2_nm_start,NightMother,Vanilla,Neutral,30,She has found servants for my family before. Let her bring you names again.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Knoten nm_start; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_020_1007,Q00,20,V2_nm_start,NightMother,Vanilla,Neutral,30,You shall judge those she finds. My children are not hers to choose.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Knoten nm_start; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
