NHV_Q00_020_1012,Q00,20,V2_nm_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,Then I will bring her back and hear her plan.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl nm_hub -> nm_close; Gates in flow.json; keine implementierten CK-Conditions.
NHV_Q00_020_1013,Q00,20,V2_nm_trust,NightMother,Vanilla,Neutral,30,Her devotion is to Sithis. Watch the work she does in his name.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Knoten nm_trust; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_020_1014,Q00,20,V2_nm_trust,NightMother,Vanilla,Neutral,30,I have given you leave to hear her. Your judgment remains your own.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Knoten nm_trust; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_020_1015,Q00,20,V2_nm_family,NightMother,Vanilla,Neutral,30,She was never bound to the family as my children are. Yet she has served it.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Knoten nm_family; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_020_1016,Q00,20,V2_nm_family,NightMother,Vanilla,Neutral,30,Some return to the door without ever calling the house their own.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Knoten nm_family; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_020_1017,Q00,20,V2_nm_voice,NightMother,Vanilla,Neutral,30,You are my Listener. It is through you that my family hears my will.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,"INACTIVE V2; Knoten nm_voice; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. Kein Datum, keine lebende Night Mother als bestätigtes Ereignis; kein Anspruch auf ein historisch immer einziges Listeneramt."
NHV_Q00_020_1018,Q00,20,V2_nm_voice,NightMother,Vanilla,Neutral,30,What passed between the Gleaner and me is not yours to carry.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,"INACTIVE V2; Knoten nm_voice; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. Kein Datum, keine lebende Night Mother als bestätigtes Ereignis; kein Anspruch auf ein historisch immer einziges Listeneramt."
NHV_Q00_020_1019,Q00,20,V2_nm_nature,NightMother,Vanilla,Neutral,30,She is the one who gathers. What else she is remains a secret in Sithis' keeping.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Knoten nm_nature; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_020_1020,Q00,20,V2_nm_nature,NightMother,Vanilla,Neutral,30,"Seek the worth of her work, my Listener. Her beginning is not your task.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Knoten nm_nature; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_020_1021,Q00,20,V2_nm_close,NightMother,Vanilla,Neutral,30,Go to her. Let the Gleaner offer her service. Let my Listener decide.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 20,INACTIVE V2; Knoten nm_close; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1000,Q00,30,V2_cicero_memory,Cicero,Vanilla,Anger,50,Cheydinhal! Now Cicero remembers. She came to Mother there. And then she left.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten cicero_memory; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1001,Q00,30,V2_cicero_memory,Cicero,Vanilla,Sad,45,Cicero stayed with the coffin. She had other doors to visit.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten cicero_memory; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
