NHV_Q00_030_1006,Q00,30,V2_cicero_duty,Cicero,Vanilla,Neutral,30,"For Mother, then. Cicero can be civil. Briefly. With effort.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten cicero_duty; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1007,Q00,30,V2_cicero_later,Cicero,Vanilla,Sad,25,Another time. Cicero will keep the grievance somewhere safe.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten cicero_later; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1008,Q00,30,V2_inn_return,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Well, Listener? Am I to remain an expense to this inn?",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten inn_return; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1009,Q00,30,V2_inn_return,Player,-,Neutral,50,She permits your work. Come back and explain your plan.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl inn_return -> return_yes; Gates in flow.json; keine implementierten CK-Conditions.
NHV_Q00_030_1010,Q00,30,V2_inn_return,Player,-,Neutral,50,She permits it. I still have doubts. Come with me.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl inn_return -> return_caution; Gates in flow.json; keine implementierten CK-Conditions.
NHV_Q00_030_1011,Q00,30,V2_inn_return,Player,-,Neutral,50,Wait here. I need more time.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl inn_return -> return_wait; Gates in flow.json; keine implementierten CK-Conditions.
NHV_Q00_030_1012,Q00,30,V2_return_wait,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Then take it. I would rather have a considered answer.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten return_wait; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1013,Q00,30,V2_return_yes,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Gladly. Nazir and Babette should hear what we propose to bring into their home.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten return_yes; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1014,Q00,30,V2_return_caution,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Keep them. We are discussing recruits, not exchanging vows. Let us return.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten return_caution; Reihenfolge und zusaetzliche Bedingungen: flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1015,Q00,30,V2_proposal_start,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,She's back. I assume the Mother has her reasons.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_start; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1016,Q00,30,V2_proposal_start,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,She permits me to help. The Listener has agreed to hear how.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_start; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1017,Q00,30,V2_proposal_start,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,I want to help you rebuild the Brotherhood by finding new members. People who can serve it beyond their next killing.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_start; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1018,Q00,30,V2_proposal_start,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"I have kept a ledger of possible candidates across Skyrim. Observations, habits, places to begin looking.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_start; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1019,Q00,30,V2_proposal_start,Player,-,Neutral,50,Tell us how you intend to choose them.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl proposal_start -> proposal_method; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_030_1020,Q00,30,V2_proposal_method,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,You find the person behind the rumors. Watch what they do when they think no one is judging.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_method; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1021,Q00,30,V2_proposal_method,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Then we devise a test. Killing may be easy for them. Restraint, obedience, or leaving an old life may prove harder.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_method; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1022,Q00,30,V2_proposal_method,Babette,Vanilla,Happy,25,A talent for murder is common. Someone who can follow instructions is a much rarer pleasure.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_method; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1023,Q00,30,V2_proposal_method,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,A name in my ledger is a possibility. You may find nothing worth bringing home.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_method; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1024,Q00,30,V2_proposal_method,Player,-,Neutral,50,And who has the final word?,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl proposal_method -> proposal_authority; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_030_1025,Q00,30,V2_proposal_authority,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"You do, Listener. I advise. You decide whether to invite them into the family, turn them away, or silence a danger.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_authority; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1026,Q00,30,V2_proposal_authority,Nazir,Vanilla,Anger,30,And you expect us to sleep beside whatever walks back through that door?,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_authority; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1027,Q00,30,V2_proposal_authority,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Only those the Listener admits. You know this house, Nazir. We will need your judgment here.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_authority; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1028,Q00,30,V2_proposal_authority,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Members need beds, food, training. Rebuilding means giving them work and a place in this Sanctuary.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_authority; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1029,Q00,30,V2_proposal_authority,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,That is my offer. I can begin with one lead. You needn't promise me a full table.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_authority; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1030,Q00,30,V2_proposal_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,"Are you offering your service, or asking to join us?",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl proposal_hub -> motive; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_030_1031,Q00,30,V2_proposal_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,Words of devotion won't make a killer trustworthy.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl proposal_hub -> trust; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_030_1032,Q00,30,V2_proposal_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,A test wouldn't have saved us from Astrid.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl proposal_hub -> astrid_warning; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_030_1033,Q00,30,V2_proposal_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,What happens if a candidate refuses?,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl proposal_hub -> refusal; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_030_1034,Q00,30,V2_proposal_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,We already have initiates. What do they lack?,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl proposal_hub -> initiates; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_030_1035,Q00,30,V2_proposal_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,Why did you leave Cheydinhal?,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl proposal_hub -> cheydinhal; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_030_1036,Q00,30,V2_proposal_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,Where would we put these new members?,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl proposal_hub -> space; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_030_1037,Q00,30,V2_proposal_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,We'll recruit carefully. I'll judge each candidate myself.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl proposal_hub -> accept; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_030_1038,Q00,30,V2_proposal_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,I'm not ready to bring strangers into this family.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl proposal_hub -> proposal_wait; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_030_1039,Q00,30,V2_motive,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,My Dread Father has not lacked for deaths. Your Brotherhood lacks people to carry on its work.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten motive; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1040,Q00,30,V2_motive,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,I offer my service to the Mother. I am not asking to join your Brotherhood.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten motive; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1041,Q00,30,V2_motive,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Happy,15,"If you accept, I will stay and keep the ledger. You will have ample time to regret my handwriting.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten motive; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1042,Q00,30,V2_trust,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Agreed. Anyone can learn the words. Watch what remains when speaking them costs something.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten trust; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1043,Q00,30,V2_trust,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,A person may begin with hatred. What matters is whether they can serve anything beyond it.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten trust; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1044,Q00,30,V2_trust,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,"And if they can't, we find out before they learn where we sleep.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten trust; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1045,Q00,30,V2_astrid_warning,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,No test promises that. Astrid had a family. She still chose to betray it.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten astrid_warning; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1046,Q00,30,V2_astrid_warning,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,We keep watching after the invitation. So should you.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten astrid_warning; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1047,Q00,30,V2_astrid_warning,Babette,Vanilla,Anger,25,"And this time, if someone starts making private arrangements for our safety, we ask whose throat pays for them.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten astrid_warning; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1048,Q00,30,V2_refusal,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Then there is no recruit. Refusing an invitation is not the same as betraying the family.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten refusal; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1049,Q00,30,V2_refusal,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"If they threaten us, you judge that danger. I will not call every refusal a threat.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten refusal; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1050,Q00,30,V2_initiates,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Nothing we have established. They have a place here. We should learn what they can do.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten initiates; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1051,Q00,30,V2_initiates,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,My ledger extends the search. It does not erase those who have already arrived.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten initiates; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1052,Q00,30,V2_cheydinhal,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,My Dread Father had other work for me. Work that could not wait.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten cheydinhal; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1053,Q00,30,V2_cheydinhal,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,I left. Cicero remained with the Mother. Duty does not spare the people we leave behind.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten cheydinhal; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1054,Q00,30,V2_cheydinhal_tail,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Sad,30,He has cause to resent me. I will answer him myself when he is willing to hear it.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten cheydinhal_tail; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1055,Q00,30,V2_space,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,I noticed an illusion over one of the walls. It may conceal a passage.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten space; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1056,Q00,30,V2_space,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"If there are usable chambers beyond it, we could make room. I haven't seen what waits inside.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten space; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1057,Q00,30,V2_proposal_wait,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Then we wait. You know what I am offering. Come back when you have an answer.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten proposal_wait; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_030_1058,Q00,30,V2_accept,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Then I will bring you leads. You will decide which become invitations.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten accept; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Erst nach letzter Response Stage 40. Einstieg fordert alle drei Pflichtblöcke; noch kein Q01-Start.
NHV_Q00_030_1059,Q00,30,V2_accept,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,I'll see to the people you bring back. You see to making them worth the trouble.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten accept; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Erst nach letzter Response Stage 40. Einstieg fordert alle drei Pflichtblöcke; noch kein Q01-Start.
NHV_Q00_030_1060,Q00,30,V2_accept,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"First, let us look for room. There is a concealed passage I would like you to see.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 30,INACTIVE V2; Knoten accept; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Erst nach letzter Response Stage 40. Einstieg fordert alle drei Pflichtblöcke; noch kein Q01-Start.
NHV_Q00_040_1000,Q00,40,V2_veil,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Here. The stone seems continuous, but the light along this edge does not belong to it.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 40,INACTIVE V2; Knoten veil; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Szene A: fünf Phasen. Tür erst nach Veyras letzter Zeile enthüllen; kein erfundener Urheber.
NHV_Q00_040_1001,Q00,40,V2_veil,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,I've walked past this wall more times than I care to count.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 40,INACTIVE V2; Knoten veil; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Szene A: fünf Phasen. Tür erst nach Veyras letzter Zeile enthüllen; kein erfundener Urheber.
NHV_Q00_040_1002,Q00,40,V2_veil,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,It was meant to escape notice. Whoever laid the veil knew their craft.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 40,INACTIVE V2; Knoten veil; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Szene A: fünf Phasen. Tür erst nach Veyras letzter Zeile enthüllen; kein erfundener Urheber.
NHV_Q00_040_1003,Q00,40,V2_veil,Babette,Vanilla,Happy,20,Do be careful. I'd hate to lose the recruits before we've even found them.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 40,INACTIVE V2; Knoten veil; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Szene A: fünf Phasen. Tür erst nach Veyras letzter Zeile enthüllen; kein erfundener Urheber.
NHV_Q00_040_1004,Q00,40,V2_veil,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Stand clear. I will loosen the veil. We will see what it was hiding.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 40,INACTIVE V2; Knoten veil; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Szene A: fünf Phasen. Tür erst nach Veyras letzter Zeile enthüllen; kein erfundener Urheber.
NHV_Q00_050_1000,Q00,50,V2_door_revealed,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,A door. I'll admit that's an improvement on a wall.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,"INACTIVE V2; Knoten door_revealed; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Sichtbare Tür ist Voraussetzung. Szene B vor Bewegung; keine Behauptung, dass Kammern bereits sicher sind."
NHV_Q00_050_1001,Q00,50,V2_door_revealed,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Old stonework. We will inspect the rooms before anyone brings down a bed.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,"INACTIVE V2; Knoten door_revealed; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Sichtbare Tür ist Voraussetzung. Szene B vor Bewegung; keine Behauptung, dass Kammern bereits sicher sind."
NHV_Q00_050_1002,Q00,50,V2_door_revealed,Babette,Vanilla,Neutral,30,Or a coffin. Some of us have standards.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,"INACTIVE V2; Knoten door_revealed; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Sichtbare Tür ist Voraussetzung. Szene B vor Bewegung; keine Behauptung, dass Kammern bereits sicher sind."
NHV_Q00_050_1003,Q00,50,V2_entry_cicero,Cicero,Vanilla,Neutral,35,Mother stays where Mother is. Cicero will inspect the new corners first.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Knoten entry_cicero; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_050_1004,Q00,50,V2_entry_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,We enter together. Keep close.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl entry_hub -> entry; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_050_1005,Q00,50,V2_entry_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,Wait. Let me get ready before we go down.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl entry_hub -> entry_wait; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_050_1006,Q00,50,V2_entry_wait,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,Take your time. I'll watch the opening.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Knoten entry_wait; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_050_1007,Q00,50,V2_entry,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Listener, take the lead. I will watch the passage behind us.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Knoten entry; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Danach gemeinsam eintreten; im Spiel Eintritt und Draugr-Kampf abwarten. Vorschau-Schaltfläche simuliert das Ende beider Ereignisse.
NHV_Q00_050_1008,Q00,50,V2_entry,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,"Babette, with me. Nobody wanders off.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Knoten entry; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Danach gemeinsam eintreten; im Spiel Eintritt und Draugr-Kampf abwarten. Vorschau-Schaltfläche simuliert das Ende beider Ereignisse.
NHV_Q00_050_1009,Q00,50,V2_entry,Babette,Vanilla,Happy,20,You make exploring a tomb sound positively domestic.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Knoten entry; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Danach gemeinsam eintreten; im Spiel Eintritt und Draugr-Kampf abwarten. Vorschau-Schaltfläche simuliert das Ende beider Ereignisse.
NHV_Q00_050_1010,Q00,50,V2_cleared,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,That accounts for the welcome. Let's check the remaining corners.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Knoten cleared; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_050_1011,Q00,50,V2_cleared,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Burial chambers, by the look of them. The dead have had the larger share of this house.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Knoten cleared; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_050_1012,Q00,50,V2_cleared,Babette,Vanilla,Neutral,30,They won't miss the elbow room.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Knoten cleared; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_050_1013,Q00,50,V2_rooms,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"This hall could take a table. A place to eat, hear reports, and discover whom not to sit beside whom.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Knoten rooms; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Rundgang zu Hall/Ledger Room; keine Freischaltung des späteren Dormitory. Danach erst zur Memorial Wall und Stage 60.
NHV_Q00_050_1014,Q00,50,V2_rooms,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,The other chambers need clearing. We can make them useful a few at a time.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Knoten rooms; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Rundgang zu Hall/Ledger Room; keine Freischaltung des späteren Dormitory. Danach erst zur Memorial Wall und Stage 60.
NHV_Q00_050_1015,Q00,50,V2_rooms,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,There is space for my ledger and your reports here. I can work while you are away.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Knoten rooms; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Rundgang zu Hall/Ledger Room; keine Freischaltung des späteren Dormitory. Danach erst zur Memorial Wall und Stage 60.
NHV_Q00_050_1016,Q00,50,V2_rooms,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,No point furnishing beds for people we haven't met. Let us begin with the names we already know.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 50,INACTIVE V2; Knoten rooms; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Rundgang zu Hall/Ledger Room; keine Freischaltung des späteren Dormitory. Danach erst zur Memorial Wall und Stage 60.
NHV_Q00_060_1000,Q00,60,V2_memorial_intro,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Sad,40,This wall will serve. Festus. Gabriella. Arnbjorn. Veezara. Their names should remain where the family can see them.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten memorial_intro; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1001,Q00,60,V2_memorial_intro,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,Names first. The people we bring here can learn what they meant.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten memorial_intro; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1002,Q00,60,V2_cicero_dead,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Sad,40,"And Cicero. Whatever came between you, he carried the Mother when she had few hands left.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten cicero_dead; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1003,Q00,60,V2_memorial_hub,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,There is one name I will leave to you. Astrid led them. She also betrayed them.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten memorial_hub; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1004,Q00,60,V2_memorial_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,Did you know the people we're remembering?,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl memorial_hub -> memorial_knowledge; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_060_1005,Q00,60,V2_memorial_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,Carve Astrid's name alongside the others.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl memorial_hub -> memorial_equal; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_060_1006,Q00,60,V2_memorial_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,Leave Astrid's name off the wall.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl memorial_hub -> memorial_none; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_060_1007,Q00,60,V2_memorial_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,"Put Astrid below the others, in smaller letters.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl memorial_hub -> memorial_small; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_060_1008,Q00,60,V2_memorial_knowledge,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,I know their names. You knew their lives. I will not pretend those are the same.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten memorial_knowledge; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1009,Q00,60,V2_memorial_knowledge,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"If you wish to tell me about them, I will listen.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten memorial_knowledge; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1010,Q00,60,V2_memorial_equal,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Then she will be named with them.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten memorial_equal; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1011,Q00,60,V2_memorial_equal,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,I'll remember what she cost us. The stone can carry the rest.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten memorial_equal; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1012,Q00,60,V2_memorial_none,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,The others' names will stand without hers.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten memorial_none; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1013,Q00,60,V2_memorial_none,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,There are enough things in this house I would rather not look at.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten memorial_none; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1014,Q00,60,V2_memorial_small,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Below them. Her place in the story, without their place of honor.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten memorial_small; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1015,Q00,60,V2_memorial_small,Nazir,Vanilla,Neutral,30,"That, I can live with.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten memorial_small; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1016,Q00,60,V2_first_lead,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Now, the first name in my ledger. Hrefna Stormhollow, near Morthal.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,"INACTIVE V2; Knoten first_lead; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Tod ist Gerücht, Hrefnas Täterschaft bleibt Q01-Ermittlung. Kein direkt empfangener Night-Mother-Auftrag behauptet."
NHV_Q00_060_1017,Q00,60,V2_first_lead,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,She performed the Black Sacrament against a moneylender who took her farm. No assassin came.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,"INACTIVE V2; Knoten first_lead; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Tod ist Gerücht, Hrefnas Täterschaft bleibt Q01-Ermittlung. Kein direkt empfangener Night-Mother-Auftrag behauptet."
NHV_Q00_060_1018,Q00,60,V2_first_lead,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Weeks later, he was found dead in the marsh. An accident, according to those who prefer not to ask.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,"INACTIVE V2; Knoten first_lead; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Tod ist Gerücht, Hrefnas Täterschaft bleibt Q01-Ermittlung. Kein direkt empfangener Night-Mother-Auftrag behauptet."
NHV_Q00_060_1019,Q00,60,V2_first_lead,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"I want you to find Hrefna. Learn whether she killed him, and what she has become since.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,"INACTIVE V2; Knoten first_lead; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Tod ist Gerücht, Hrefnas Täterschaft bleibt Q01-Ermittlung. Kein direkt empfangener Night-Mother-Auftrag behauptet."
NHV_Q00_060_1020,Q00,60,V2_lead_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,A desperate murder doesn't make her one of us.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl lead_hub -> lead_judgment; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_060_1021,Q00,60,V2_lead_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,Where should I begin looking?,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl lead_hub -> lead_where; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_060_1022,Q00,60,V2_lead_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,Why did no one answer her sacrament?,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl lead_hub -> lead_silence; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_060_1023,Q00,60,V2_lead_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,I'll investigate Hrefna. I haven't promised her a place.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl lead_hub -> lead_accept; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_060_1024,Q00,60,V2_lead_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,I need a moment before we discuss the journey.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl lead_hub -> lead_wait; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_060_1025,Q00,60,V2_lead_judgment,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Precisely. Grief may have moved her once. It tells us little about what she would do tomorrow.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten lead_judgment; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1026,Q00,60,V2_lead_judgment,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Find out before you offer anything. We are looking for a person, not collecting a debt.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten lead_judgment; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1027,Q00,60,V2_lead_where,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Morthal. Ask Hakan Reed-Walker, a fisherman, about the death of Eirik Ashmark. The names are in my ledger.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten lead_where; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1028,Q00,60,V2_lead_where,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Follow what you find to Hrefna. Then bring me what you learned. We will decide how to test her.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten lead_where; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1029,Q00,60,V2_lead_silence,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,I know she waited through the family's troubles. I cannot tell you what the Mother heard in that time.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten lead_silence; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1030,Q00,60,V2_lead_silence,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Hrefna knows only that no one came. Begin with what that did to her.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten lead_silence; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1031,Q00,60,V2_lead_wait,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Of course. A journey into the marsh deserves at least a dry pair of boots.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten lead_wait; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_060_1032,Q00,60,V2_lead_accept,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Good. Morthal first, Hakan Reed-Walker, then the farm. I have written down what I know.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 60,INACTIVE V2; Knoten lead_accept; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. FinishQ00Contract entspricht dem Übergang zu Stage 80; Ledger/Q01 erst beim vorhandenen CompleteQ00-Abschluss.
NHV_Q00_080_1000,Q00,80,V2_doubt,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Before you go, there is something else I can offer. A witness to my work.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 80,INACTIVE V2; Knoten doubt; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_080_1001,Q00,80,V2_doubt,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,Someone who knew my work before I came to your door. You might find his account less irritating than mine.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 80,INACTIVE V2; Knoten doubt; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_080_1002,Q00,80,V2_doubt,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"I could ask him to join us. If you would rather judge me yourself, we can leave it there.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 80,INACTIVE V2; Knoten doubt; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_080_1003,Q00,80,V2_doubt,Player,-,Neutral,50,Call your witness. I would hear what he knows of you.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 80,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl doubt -> summon_accept; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_080_1004,Q00,80,V2_doubt,Player,-,Neutral,50,Your work can speak for you. Give me the ledger.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 80,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl doubt -> doubt_decline; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_080_1005,Q00,80,V2_doubt,Player,-,Neutral,50,Keep your witnesses. I have a candidate to find.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 80,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl doubt -> doubt_sharp; Gates in flow.json.
NHV_Q00_080_1006,Q00,80,V2_summon_accept,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Then take the ledger. Whatever he tells you, Hrefna still needs finding.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 80,"INACTIVE V2; Knoten summon_accept; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Am Response-Ende OnDoubtAccepted: vorhandene Reihenfolge CompleteQ00, dann SummonLucien; Q01 startet unabhängig von Lucien-Gespräch."
NHV_Q00_080_1007,Q00,80,V2_doubt_decline,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Fairly said. Take it. If you later want to speak with him, ask me.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 80,INACTIVE V2; Knoten doubt_decline; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. OnDoubtDeclined; Q00 Stage 100 und Q01 starten; späterer Ruf bleibt möglich.
NHV_Q00_080_1008,Q00,80,V2_doubt_sharp,Veyra,NHV_VoiceVeyra,Neutral,30,"Then I will not delay you. The ledger, as promised. May your first report be worth the ink.",GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 80,INACTIVE V2; Knoten doubt_sharp; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. Gleicher Abschluss wie höfliche Ablehnung; kein versteckter Malus.
