NHV_Q00_100_1007,Q00,100,V2_lucien_hub,Player,-,Neutral,50,I have what I need. Thank you.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 100,INACTIVE V2; Auswahl lucien_hub -> end; Gates in flow.json.
