NHV_Q00_100_1023,Q00,100,V2_veyra_calling,Lucien,Vanilla,Neutral,30,She called. I answered. There was no chain about my throat.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 100,INACTIVE V2; Feinschliff 29.09.2026; Ablauf und Gates in flow.json. 
