NHV_Q00_100_1008,Q00,100,V2_lucien_vouch,Lucien,Vanilla,Neutral,30,I knew her work in Cheydinhal. She brought names to our attention. Some became useful servants of Sithis.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 100,INACTIVE V2; Knoten lucien_vouch; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_100_1009,Q00,100,V2_lucien_vouch,Lucien,Vanilla,Neutral,30,She understood the difference between finding a killer and choosing a brother. I suggest you remember it as well.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 100,INACTIVE V2; Knoten lucien_vouch; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_100_1010,Q00,100,V2_lucien_judgment,Lucien,Vanilla,Neutral,30,With finding candidates? Yes. With making your decisions? I would trust no one.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 100,INACTIVE V2; Knoten lucien_judgment; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
NHV_Q00_100_1011,Q00,100,V2_lucien_judgment,Lucien,Vanilla,Neutral,30,She serves Sithis. That is my testimony. What you build with her help remains your responsibility.,GetStage NHV_Q00_ShadowAtTheDoor == 100,INACTIVE V2; Knoten lucien_judgment; Ablauf/Gates in flow.json. 
